n=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,23)\">Gen 7:23</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,8)\">Ezek 9:8</ref> (but on text see above); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַנּ</bdbheb> = <highlight>the survivors</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 14:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,10)\">Gen 14:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 11:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,11,11)\">1Sam 11:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,21)\">Ezek 17:21</ref> participle as technical term = <highlight>the</highlight> (purified) <highlight>remainder, remnant</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>שְׁאָר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שְׁאֵרִית</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Isa 4:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,3)\">Isa 4:3</ref> (<bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> location; ||), <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:21\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,21)\">2Chr 34:21</ref> (<bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> location). — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַנּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,24)\">1Sam 9:24</ref> is dubious; <highlight>what is left over</highlight>, in polite depreciation, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup>; read <bdbheb>הַשְּׁאֵר</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be left behind</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Exod 10:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,26)\">Exod 10:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 11:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,26)\">Num 11:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); with <bdbheb>לְבַדּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 42:38\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,38)\">Gen 42:38</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"Isa 49:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,21)\">Isa 49:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:8\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,8)\">Dan 10:8</ref> of widow <ref ref=\"Ruth 1:3\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(8,1,3)\">Ruth 1:3</ref> + <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> of the dead v<ref ref=\"Ruth 1:5\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(8,1,5)\">Ruth 1:5</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular<bdbheb>הִשְׁאִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 10:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,12)\">Exod 10:12</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יַשְׁאִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 28:51\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,51)\">Deut 28:51</ref>, 1 plural <bdbheb>נַשְׁאֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:36\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,36)\">1Sam 14:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:48g»§ 48g</sup>; «GKC:109d»109d <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>p. 466 f.</sup></lookup>), etc.; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הַשְׁאִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:8\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,8)\">Ezra 9:8</ref>, see also below; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>leave over, spare</highlight>, with accusative <ref ref=\"Exod 10:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,12)\">Exod 10:12</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:22\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,22)\">2Kgs 25:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,9)\">Jer 49:9</ref> = <ref ref=\"Obad 1:5\" b=\"31\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(31,1,5)\">Obad 1:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 11:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,14)\">Josh 11:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 6:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,4)\">Judg 6:4</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶסְלַח לַאֲשֶׁר אַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 50:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,20)\">Jer 50:20</ref> especially <bdbheb>שָׂרִיד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֹא הִשׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>leave no survivor</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Josh 10:28\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,28)\">Josh 10:28</ref>, cf v<ref ref=\"Josh 10:30\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,30)\">Josh 10:30</ref> v<ref ref=\"Josh 10:37\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,37)\">Josh 10:37</ref> v<ref ref=\"Josh 10:39\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,39)\">Josh 10:39</ref> v<ref ref=\"Josh 10:40\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,40)\">Josh 10:40</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דְַבִּֿלְתִּי הִשׁ</bdbheb> (sometimes with <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> person) <ref ref=\"Num 21:35\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,35)\">Num 21:35</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) = <ref ref=\"Deut 3:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,3)\">Deut 3:3</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Deut 2:34\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,34)\">Deut 2:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 8:22\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,22)\">Josh 8:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 11:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,8)\">Josh 11:8</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Josh 10:33\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,33)\">Josh 10:33</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,11)\">2Kgs 10:11</ref>, and <bdbheb>מִבְּלִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לוֺ כֹּ֑ל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הִשׁ</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Deut 28:55\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"55\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"55\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,55)\">Deut 28:55</ref> (in all these read <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשׁ</bdbheb>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"Deut 3:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,3)\">Deut 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 7:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,24)\">Deut 7:24</ref></sup></lookup>); with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>, <highlight>among, of</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:36\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,36)\">1Sam 14:36</ref>, <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> location <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=